# Large raw molecular-dynamics trajectories are NOT part of this Git repository.
# They are archived separately (Zenodo; DOI to be issued on acceptance).
*.xtc
*.trr
*.edr
*.cpt
*.tpr
*.gro
*.pdb
*.pdbqt
# keep npt.gro (small post-equilibration structure, needed by verify_rg.py) and input pdbs if added later
!analysis/md/npt.gro
# keep the six tleap-built mutant starting coordinates (small, unsolvated complex;
# needed by verify_mutant_topologies.py and claimed as deposited in the README)
!analysis/scan/rep1/complex_*.gro

# The four docked poses and the two source structures are small (4.6 MB total) and are
# required to reproduce the Fig. 1 geometry, so they are tracked despite the patterns above.
!analysis/docking/*.pdbqt
!analysis/docking/structures/
!analysis/docking/structures/*.pdb
!analysis/docking/structures/*.pdbqt
